    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "September marks the return to school, and Louis Vuitton has unveiled its new \"Back to School\" collection for 2026. Inspired by the campus comeback, the new bags are crafted primarily from soft suede calfskin and rendered in autumn-ready shades of mocha, chocolate, and latte browns, exuding a rich collegiate vintage vibe.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
