    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Monogram Canvas ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "No campus look is complete without a backpack. The newly introduced Diane Backpack arrives with a clean square silhouette, its signature Monogram canvas body accented by contrast leather trim. The flap closure features a belt-buckle design, lending a vintage academic flair. The Nano Frivole, inspired by the classic Noé bucket bag, takes on a clever horizontal shape and is finished with a drawstring cinch, making it both lightweight and adorable.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
