      "text": "The standout piece of the season is the Capucines Edito. Its modern horizontal proportions and sleek trapezoidal shape give it a commanding presence. Crafted from mocha suede calfskin paired with lustrous leather, the bag's naturally slouchy opening creates striking visual depth and a three-dimensional feel.",
