    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The two essential elements of fall/winter accessorizing—supple, refined suede and warm, earthy tones—both appear in this group of classic bags. You'll find soft latte suede calfskin embossed with the Monogram pattern, paired with dark brown leather and gold-tone hardware, radiating a rich autumnal mood.",
